  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **New Endpoints**:\n  - Added Regions endpoint (All, ByRegionID).\n  - Added Countries endpoint (All).\n  - Added Utility endpoint (GetApiLimit) to check API key allowance without consuming quota.\n- **New Game Endpoints**:\n  - Added Games/ByGameUniqueID for searching by unique/external identifier (e.g. ROM serial).\n  - Added Games/ByGameHash for searching by ROM hash with optional hash type filter.\n- **Model Fixes**:\n  - Fixed PlatformFields enum values (were incorrectly copied from GameFields).\n  - Added missing PlatformModel fields: Manufacturer, Media, CPU, Memory, Graphics, Sound, MaxControllers, Display, YouTube.\n  - Added RegionId and CountryId to GameModel.\n  - Fixed ImageBaseUrlMetaModel property name typo: Lage → Large.\n- **Enhancements**:\n  - Registered HttpClient in dependency injection following .NET best practices with named client support.\n  - Added HttpTimeout configuration property (defaults to 180 seconds).\n  - Improved HTTP client lifecycle management through DI container.\n- **Breaking Changes**:\n  - Removed incorrect PlatformFields enum members. Renamed ImageBaseUrlMetaModel.Lage to Large.",
